{
  "dataset": "screenshots-synthetic-v1",
  "input_kind": "screenshot",
  "description": "Synthetic screenshots of fictional meal-tracking apps (ごはんログ / ミールノート / MealDiary) with exactly-known on-screen nutrition values, plus non-meal hard negatives. Covers single meals (light/dark, dense, one-decimal grams), day views (totals = day total, alt = largest meal), consistent two-image pairs (list+kcal / PFC chart), mismatched pairs (expect_warning=true) and non-meal apps (is_meal=false). Ground truth = on-screen totals truncated to integers, as SCREENSHOT_SYSTEM_PROMPT instructs.",
  "source": "Synthetic screenshots rendered by generators/screenshots (fictional apps; HTML rendered with headless Chromium)",
  "preprocessing": "iPhone 390x844pt @3x = 1170x2532 PNG -> fit inside 1920x1080, no enlargement (=> 499x1080), JPEG q80 (same as StorageService.pickImage: maxWidth 1920, maxHeight 1080, imageQuality 80)",
